<title>USA: LightPath completes $1.8 mln placement.</title>
<headline>LightPath completes $1.8 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>LightPath Technologies Inc said Tuesday it completed a $1.8 million private placement of convertible preferred stock and attached warrants.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of gradium glass said it will use the $1.6 million net proceeds for general corporate purposes and working capital.</p>
<p>LightPath's stock hit a new 52-week high of 13-3/4 Tuesday, and traded at 13, up 7/8, in the afternoon.</p>
